OL,3,GNEWSAM&S finalising early 2027 start
OL,4,Afor new store
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is set to begin early next year on
OL,7,Fa new #31m Marks and Spencer (M&S)
OL,8,Fstore which will take over and extend a
OL,9,Fformer Toys R Us.
OL,11,FThe retailer said it was finalising
OL,12,Fplans for a flagship food and clothing
OL,13,Foutlet at Copdock Interchange, near
OL,14,FIpswich, which was approved in December
OL,15,Flast year.
OL,17,FIt had initially given a target opening
OL,18,Fof July 2027, but it said it was now
OL,19,Faiming for autumn 2027, which was also
OL,20,Fsubject to change.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
