OL,3,GNEWSAM&S finalising early 2027 start
OL,4,Afor new store
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our new 60,000 sq ft full-line store
OL,7,Fwill offer the very best of M&S food,
OL,8,Ffashion and beauty for customers and
OL,9,Fcreate over 120 new local jobs," a
OL,10,Fspokeswoman said.
